# Venser, Fervent Forger: "Copy target instant or sorcery spell an opponent controls twice" - a copy is made as the ability
# resolves, and a spell that has left the stack by then is copied not at all (CR 608.2b). Bot1 shocks Bot2, Bot2 bolts Bot1
# back, and Bot1 answers the Bolt with Venser (flash), whose trigger targets the Bolt; Bot2 then counters its own Bolt with
# Counterspell, so when Venser's trigger resolves its target is gone: no copies, and no Bolt damage either.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
